# Dependencies
# No trailing slash: a git worktree gets `node_modules` as a SYMLINK to the main
# checkout, and `node_modules/` (directory-only) does not match a symlink — which
# is how one got committed once.
node_modules

# The .sandcastle/ artifact boundary lives in .sandcastle/.gitignore — the same
# tracked file adoption ships to a consumer (issue #29): the config layer IS
# tracked there (config.ts and friends are project decisions), and only what a
# run materializes locally (.env*, logs/, worktrees/, the Engine install) is
# ignored. One boundary file, shared by the Factory and every instance.

# Local Claude settings (per-developer)
.claude/settings.local.json
